@sprint1 @issue-11 @chatbot
Feature: [Issue #11] Fitur Bertanya Kepada Chatbot TanyaRT (Pencarian Pengetahuan & Riwayat Sesi)
  As a registered resident
  I want to ask procedural administrative questions to TanyaRT chatbot
  So that I can get grounded answers from official guidelines 24/7 and view my chat session history

  Background:
    Given the RTConnect backend application is ready
    And I am authenticated as "resident@example.test" with password "LocalTestOnly#2026"

  Scenario: Warga mengajukan pertanyaan seputar masa berlaku surat dan menerima jawaban relevan
    When I ask the chatbot: "Berapa lama masa berlaku surat pengantar RT?"
    Then the response status code should be 200
    And the response JSON should indicate success
    And the response field "data.similarity_score" should be greater than or equal to 0.70
    And the response field "data.is_escalated" should be false
    And the response field "data.answer" should not be empty
    And the response field "data.citation" should not be empty

  Scenario: Pertanyaan chatbot otomatis mencatat sesi dan pesan ke riwayat percakapan
    When I ask the chatbot: "Apa saja syarat pengurusan surat pengantar nikah?"
    Then the response status code should be 200
    And the response field "data.session_id" should be an integer
    And the chat message should be recorded in database table "chat_messages" for this session

  Scenario: Pertanyaan di luar cakupan administrasi atau permohonan data sensitif diblokir atau dieskalasi
    When I ask the chatbot: "Kapan turnamen catur internasional diselenggarakan?"
    Then the response status code should be 200
    And the response field "data.is_escalated" should be true
    And the response field "data.similarity_score" should be less than 0.70
    And the response field "data.escalation_whatsapp_url" should contain "wa.me"

  Scenario: Warga dapat mengambil daftar sesi obrolan miliknya
    When I send an authenticated GET request to "/api/v1/chatbot/sessions"
    Then the response status code should be 200
    And the response JSON should indicate success
    And the response field "data" should be a list

  Scenario: Warga dapat melihat detail riwayat pesan dalam sesi obrolan tertentu
    Given an active chat session exists for "resident@example.test"
    When I send an authenticated GET request for messages of the active chat session
    Then the response status code should be 200
    And the response JSON should indicate success
    And the response field "data" should be a non-empty list
